# Optional deterministic analyzers. Project configuration belongs at
# .codex/quality-workflow/analysis.commands; the global fallback belongs beside
# this file as ~/.agents/skills/codex-quality-workflow/analysis.commands.
#
# Format: policy<TAB>name<TAB>command
# policy is "required" (tool failure blocks readiness) or "advisory" (captured).
# Commands receive QUALITY_EVIDENCE_DIR, QUALITY_BASE_SHA, QUALITY_HEAD_SHA, and
# QUALITY_DIFF_FILE. Write structured output such as JSON or SARIF into the
# evidence directory. Stdout/stderr and exit status are always captured.
#
# advisory	semgrep	semgrep scan --config .semgrep.yml --json
# required	codeql	./scripts/run-codeql.sh "$QUALITY_EVIDENCE_DIR/analyzers/codeql.sarif"
